y, this allows for better fake area lights using bright custom ambient colors:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/30f868c0-288e-4c73-bd6b-6aacfb745c05)\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/081f6c03-7617-43dd-9cdc-f26c0d7843f5)\r\n\r\nIn Compatibility, I get a shader compilation error and the scene looks fully white. This doesn't occur in `master`.\r\n\r\n```\r\nERROR: SceneShaderGLES3: Fragment shader compilation failed:\r\n0(1085) : error C1503: undefined variable \"reflections\"\r\n0(1085) : error C1503: undefined variable \"ref_index\"\r\n0(1087) : error C1503: undefined variable \"reflections\"\r\n0(1087) : error C1503: undefined variable \"ref_index\"\r\n```","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99958#pullrequestreview-2476085804","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99958","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2024-12-03T15:44:15Z"},{"id":2478872161,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6TwJZh","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"It works great in Compatibility now :slightly_smiling_face: ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99958#pullrequestreview-2478872161","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99958","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2024-12-04T14:29:43Z"},{"id":2475484016,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6TjONw","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"h